WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.167
Week 26: Conditional, Courtesy, and Hypothesis. make a tactful request evaluate options state hypothetical consequences

2
00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:15.647
Cultural lens. Indirectness and face-saving strategies in disagreement and requests.

3
00:00:15.647 --> 00:00:27.825
Avoid the single-story trap. Treat country, region, age, relationship, and setting as variables. Describe the evidence you have without turning one example into a universal rule.

4
00:00:27.825 --> 00:00:39.853
Language variation. Recognize regional choices and ask what a form means locally. Use the neutral course model for production until the situation gives you a reason to adapt.

5
00:00:39.853 --> 00:00:48.874
Reflection. Compare this context with one you know. Name one similarity, one difference, and one question that would prevent an assumption.

6
00:00:48.874 --> 00:01:17.841
Model language. La indirección ayuda a proteger la imagen social. — Indirectness helps save social face. Algunas personas suavizan un desacuerdo. — Some people soften a disagreement. Otras usan una estrategia más directa. — Others use a more direct strategy. Esto varía según la relación. — This varies depending on the relationship. No hay una única forma correcta. — There isn't a single correct way.

7
00:01:17.841 --> 00:01:27.846
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
